@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
autonumber
title UC-03 | child checkpoint and duplicate-safe synchronization
participant "Child app" as C
database "Local store / outbox" as L
participant "Progress module" as P
database "Transactional store" as DB
C -> L : Save checkpoint + unique event (revision R1)
L --> C : Durable local save
C -> P : Submit scoped event
P -> DB : Validate learner session, revision and availability
alt Unauthorized or withdrawn
 P --> C : Access/unavailable result; no new delivery
else Existing event ID, same payload
 DB --> P : Prior committed result
 P --> C : Same result; no duplicate completion
else Existing ID, different payload
 P --> C : Reject identifier conflict
else New valid event
 P -> DB : Atomically merge completed steps
 note right of DB
 Update cursor only with valid newer sequence.
 Record receipt and optional completion.
 No raw choices or reflections stored.
 end note
 DB --> P : Durable commit
 P --> C : Confirmed progress / completion
end
opt Success acknowledgment received
 C -> L : Mark event acknowledged
end
note over C, L
Transport failure retains event for retry with the same ID.
No server-sync claim before acknowledgment.
end note
C -> P : Resume own attempt after valid access
P -> DB : Read only authenticated learner's attempt
DB --> P : Confirmed state
P --> C : Resume checkpoint and completed steps
note over P, DB
Routine R2 publication preserves the bound R1 attempt.
R1 withdrawal takes precedence over continued access.
end note
@enduml
